				"description": "{H6 Memorial Advanced Exchange}\n\nAn exchange in memory of H6: swaps creatures of the five original towns (Castle, Necropolis, Inferno, Stronghold, Dungeon) with H6 creatures of the same faction and level (levels 1-7; H6 Haven pairs with Castle). Basic creatures swap for basic creatures; upgraded creatures of the same line (original upgrades, H6 upgrades, and upgrades from the Tides of War and Third Upgrades mods) can be swapped freely among one another. Shrunk and Downgraded troops (any level) can be restored to their original form here. Free, with unlimited visits; you pay the difference only when exchanging into the more expensive Tides of War or Third Upgrades forms (or from them into a more expensive form), in batches by count. Only one creature type is exchanged at a time; to exchange another, press Space to visit again.",
